<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Version 0.1.1  Updated to support version format of x.x.x (drop build support for loading).  
Version 0.2  Added support for creation of python orchestration code.  
Version 0.2.1  Bug fix for orchestration parse when no EOL present at end of config.  Updated errors returned over gRPC to include &lt;err&gt; at beginning for LV display. s 
Version 0.3.0 Update to use new Status data that includes new benchmark data with averages and custom benchmarks.  
Version 0.4.0 proto file updates to use cif.common proto file.  
Version 0.5.0 Support added for multi-fifo connections.
Version 0.5.1 Update to Python script.
Version 0.5.2 Update to support CIPC channels.
Version 0.6.0 Update to support CIPC FIFO channels.
Version 1.0.0 Align with version numbers of UI.
Version 1.1.0 Update of gRPC to provide plugin metadata and clock info.
Version 1.1.1 Use new clock filtering, update to remove plug discovery call on new plugin for performance.
Version 1.1.2 Discovery moved to parallel loop for responsiveness of gRPC.
Version 1.2.0 Update to new paths to support Windows and Linux
Version 1.2.1 Only update plugin list if new version to improve responsiveness.
Version 1.2.2 Only update plugin list to provide partial updates to improve responsiveness.
Version 1.2.3 Read only open for monitoring logs.
Version 1.3.3 Wall clock time for reading logs.
Version 1.4.1 Cache of plug-in info for faster load time.
Version 1.4.2 Logging added
Version 1.4.3 Optimization for UI performance and muting of client timeout errors
Version 1.4.5 Update log reading for performance improvement and to support Linux leap-second configuration. 
Version 1.4.6 Move functions to parallel loops for performance improvement. Mute error -2 from client timeout. 
Version 1.4.7 Bug fix where some functions had not migrated to DVR for plugin map.  Removed map from class to confirm everything is using DVR.  
Version 2.0.0 Breaking change.  Update to call external plugin loaders to load plugins as new process.  Update of gRPC core.
Version 2.1.0  Split manager to new repo for licensing.  
Version 2.1.1 Disable registering gRPC descriptors.
Version 2.2.0 Support updated core with events, check for free port before launching manager.
Version 2.2.1 Handle large log files with log file limit.
Version 2.2.2 Update to RT loader interlock, bug fix on log reset.</Property>
